WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.550
No browser wallet. The owner signs in with an email.
Dynamic makes a wallet for them on the first sign-in.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.550
A one-time code goes to that inbox.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.750
Signed in. Dynamic has made the wallet, 0x790E…10cc.
It is the owner of this agent now. No seed phrase.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:19.050
The owner brings agent 29 back on.
The embedded wallet signs it, like any other signer.

5
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.050
Our live agent holds no private key.
It signs through a Dynamic 2-of-2 MPC server wallet.

6
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.850
It trades and reports in every hour,
and still asks the switch before every action.

7
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:35.650
On chain, an ordinary signed transaction.
From the agent’s own address, with neither half of the key alone.

